    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GeTrix is a modern reinvention of the classic block-falling game, powered by intuitive <strong>gesture controls, </strong>where a camera tracks your hands. Whether you're stacking solo or waving your way through the challenge mode, GeTrix delivers a fresh and futuristic twist to a timeless favorite.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u270b <strong>How It Works \u2013 Gesture Controls</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play using just your hand and a webcam:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u261d\ufe0f <strong>Index finger</strong> \u2013 Move block <strong>left</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd19 <strong>Pinky finger</strong> \u2013 Move block <strong>right</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83e\udd1aPalm\u00a0</strong>\u2013 <strong>Rotate</strong> block</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd95 <strong>Middle finger</strong> \u2013 <strong>Drop</strong> block faster</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prefer traditional controls? Use your <strong>keyboard </strong>to play classic-style too!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To use it, just use the arrow keys in order to play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GeTrix is a modern reinvention of the classic block-falling game, powered by intuitive <strong>gesture controls, </strong>where a camera tracks your hands. Whether you're stacking solo or waving your way through the challenge mode, GeTrix delivers a fresh and futuristic twist to a timeless favorite.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u270b <strong>How It Works \u2013 Gesture Controls</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play using just your hand and a webcam:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u261d\ufe0f <strong>Index finger</strong> \u2013 Move block <strong>left</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd19 <strong>Pinky finger</strong> \u2013 Move block <strong>right</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83e\udd1aPalm\u00a0</strong>\u2013 <strong>Rotate</strong> block</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd95 <strong>Middle finger</strong> \u2013 <strong>Drop</strong> block faster</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prefer traditional controls? Use your <strong>keyboard </strong>to play classic-style too!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To use it, just use the arrow keys in order to play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
